title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/cursor:prev
catalog: GUI command
target: cursor:prev
summary: Move a panel's cursor up one row (self / a panel type)

!! Reference

* Defined by the shell (a builtin)

!! Default keys

* ``k`` → ``cursor:prev self``
* ``up`` → ``cursor:prev self``
* ``up`` → ``cursor:prev metarecord-list`` (while ``finder`` is focused)
* ``up`` → ``cursor:prev metarecord-list`` (in the ``viewer`` panel)
